<h1>About</h1>

<div class="prose about">
  <p>Broker Registry is an independently operated registry for individuals who broker or sell commercial financing in the United States. Registrants complete training on financing products, professional conduct, and applicable laws, pass an assessment, and maintain an annual registration that anyone can verify by number. Registration numbers are permanently assigned to individuals. Registration is not a license, background check, or guarantee of professional conduct. See our <a href="/legal/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> for more information.</p>
</div>

